5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the seasons. Last winter, our plans fell apart when the roads closed.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The location of our services decides who can actually reach them. I need to see the gaps.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,We keep guessing. I want to see what happened to the old outreach stops.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Budgets look fine on day one, then vanish. I need to see the funding structure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,We add tasks without checking if anyone can do them. I need to see the skills.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, the old stops might show us what works when conditions are bad.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, yes. If the roads close, we need to know who is left behind.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, the funding shape matters. I am looking at the old records too.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, skills are the hidden cost. I am checking the grant terms.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, if we can't reach them, the service is empty. I am checking the register.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the winter road closures. They define our limits.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the bus links in the outer wards. That is the access map.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will review the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. Data beats memory.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment. That is the trap.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the volunteer register and supervision training. Who is actually qualified?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
