35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The roads closed for eleven days, but the community halls kept their evening timetables.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,Two outer wards lost their bus link. Residents now face an hour's round trip.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The old digitisation batch left half its images unindexed. The partner groups still meet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The grant pays for twelve months only. After that, the flat budget carries the cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"A dozen retired tradespeople run the repair clinic, but no one on payroll is trained to supervise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, if the bus is gone, the mobile service is the only link.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, exactly. The mobile service fills the gap the bus left.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Benjamin, the grant trap is real. We need to know what survives after year one.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, yes. The equipment line overran by a third last year. That is a warning.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, the community halls are resilient. We should partner with them, not replace them.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The attendance sheets show forty visitors a session in the outer wards. That is high.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks after nine. We are missing them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The partner-run groups are stable. The digitisation project stalled. That is a clear signal.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The vehicle running line overran. We need to be careful with mobile costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,The tool certification lapsed. The technician retired. We cannot rely on that for new tools.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
